{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35739","headline":"远公亭牡丹 · 李咸用","name":"远公亭牡丹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雁门禅客吟春亭，牡丹独逞花中英。\n双成腻脸偎云屏，百般姿态因风生。\n延年不敢歌倾城，朝云暮雨愁娉婷。\n蘂繁蚁脚黏不行，甜迷蜂醉飞无声。\n庐山根脚含精灵，发妍吐秀丛君庭。\n湓江太守多闲情，栏朱绕绦留轻盈。\n潺潺绿醴当风倾，平头奴子啾银笙。\n红葩艳艳交童星，左文右武怜君荣，白铜鞮上慙清明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35739.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35739","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}